<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Vanuatu</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Vanuatu is an island nation in the south-western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pacific-ocean">Pacific Ocean</a>, formerly known as the New <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hebrides">Hebrides</a>. It was governed as an Anglo-French condominium. Accounts of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/french-colonial-empire">French Empire</a> note that Vanuatu's independence in 1980 completed the process of French <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/decolonisation">decolonisation</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/vanuatu.jpg" alt="Vanuatu" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Kalontas Mahlon · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Vanuatu_(official).svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
